{"i":751,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Cole","text":"Fenn saved me with the rope, so a pact with him secures loyalty and covers a debt that could look good to jury. Breaking Hana would be risky since she saved me on the step, but Fenn is more crucial for survival. Accept Fenn's offer to lock it in."}
