{"i":782,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","name":"Cole","text":"Hana wants me to vote Ash, but Ash offered a pact and I owe Gus but not Ash. I could use Hana's vote to eliminate Ash while keeping Fenn. I'll campaign to sway votes my way and stay flexible."}
{"i":784,"type":"whisper","stage":"vote","round":2,"phase":"campaign","from":"Cole","to":"Hana","text":"I'll consider it. Let's talk after this round."}
