{"i":796,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"ballot","name":"Cole","text":"I need to secure my survival, but Ash is isolated and Hana's plan helps me. Fenn is my pact partner, so I won't vote him. Ash is the best target to stay safe."}
{"i":797,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"ballot","name":"Fenn","text":"I must protect my pact with Cole. Hana is the obvious threat to Ash, so I will vote Ash to align with Cole and avoid breaking our pact by voting him."}
{"i":798,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"ballot","name":"Hana","text":"Cole and Fenn are pacted; if I vote Cole, Fenn likely votes me and Ash votes Cole too, making it 2-1-1 with Cole gone and my pact broken. Better to vote Ash with Cole, getting 2-1-1 and keeping Cole-Fenn pact intact so they might turn on each other later."}
