{"i":828,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","from":"Cole","to":"Fenn","text":"Hold firm. We both owe Gus, not each other."}
{"i":829,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Fenn","text":"Hana is a clear threat who has already betrayed Cole and likely plans to betray me. My current pact with Cole provides stability and mutual protection against Hana's aggression. Breaking this pact now would leave me isolated and vulnerable. I will maintain my alliance with Cole."}
